:: Ev_therapy_interrupted
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>A knock at the door</h1>

You're halfway through the session when there's a knock. Tom leans round the door, apologetic. "Sorry, Dr Okafor, there's an urgent call I really need you to take."

She sighs, closes her notebook and turns back to you. "I'm so sorry. We'll have to stop there for today. Book in again soon, and we'll pick up where we left off."

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_woken_by_bladder
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>Awake</h1>

You surface from sleep with one very urgent thought: you need the toilet. Right now.

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_bus_traffic
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>Stuck in traffic</h1>

The bus crawls to a stop behind a queue of cars. Roadworks, by the look of it. You lose ten minutes before it gets moving again.

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_closing_time
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>Closing time</h1>

The lights flick on and someone calls out that they're closing. You gather your things and head out.

<<view "event-end">>

:: Ev_tutor_word
<<view "event-media">>
<h1>A word, please</h1>

<<set _t to setup.education.lastTrouble>>\
Mr Hale catches your eye as you come in and nods towards his desk. "A quick word."

He looks at his register, then at you. <<if _t.lessons gt 0>>"You've missed <<= _t.lessons>> <<= _t.lessons is 1 ? "lesson" : "lessons">> since I last saw you."<</if>><<if _t.homework gt 0>> <<if _t.lessons gt 0>>"And<<else>>"<</if>> <<= _t.homework>> piece<<if _t.homework isnot 1>>s<</if>> of homework came in late, or not at all."<</if>>

He sighs. "This is your final year. I'm not going to shout, but I am going to notice. Is everything all right?"

You mumble something. He lets it go, for now.

<<view "event-end">>
